ku\": \"BL-SPH500\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sph500\", \"category\": \"sphere\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-sph500.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 5000, \"highPrice\": 30000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sph500\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"5.0mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"Up to 16K equivalent\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the SphereVision Immersive 5mm, and how does it affect display quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 5.0mm, offering a fine balance between resolution and viewing distance. This ensures crisp, clear visuals suited for immersive dome environments, delivering vibrant imagery without visible pixelation from typical viewing ranges.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED sphere display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation involves custom structural support tailored to the dome's diameter, which ranges from 5m to over 30m. Our expert team collaborates with architects and engineers to ensure safe, precise assembly optimized for your space.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the SphereVision Immersive 5mm be integrated with spatial audio systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is fully compatible with spatial audio technology, enabling a multi-sensory immersive experience by synchronizing high-fidelity sound with the 360-degree visuals within the dome.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SphereVision Immersive 5mm compare with traditional projection domes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional projection domes dependent on projectors, SphereVision delivers direct LED illumination, providing higher brightness (800 nits), superior contrast, and richer colors with consistent image quality even in ambient light.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are provided with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty coverage typically spanning 2-3 years, including parts and technical support. Extended maintenance programs can be customized to match project requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of content can be displayed on the SphereVision Immersive 5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports real-time dome mapping content, enabling dynamic, immersive visuals ideal for planetarium shows, thematic park attractions, and interactive art installations that demand high-resolution panoramic displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected lifespan and maintenance requirements of this LED sphere?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With premium LED components, the SphereVision Immersive 5mm typically offers over 100,000 hours of operation. Scheduled maintenance focuses on cleaning, calibration, and software updates to sustain optimal performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pricing for the SphereVision Immersive 5mm vary?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing depends on dome size, resolution requirements, and installation complexity, starting generally from mid-range for smaller setups up to premium for large-scale 30m+ diameter installations with full customizations.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"SphereVision Immersive 5mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sph500\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>SphereVision Immersive 5mm</h1><p>Brightluxx offers SphereVision Immersive 5mm LED displays in Dubai for stunning visual impact. Call for a quote in UAE today!</p><p><strong>Walk inside the display. Dome-scale immersion.</strong></p><p>Large-format LED sphere/dome for immersive walk-in experiences. Scales from 5m to 30m+ diameter for planetariums, theme parks, and immersive art installations. Interior projection with 16K equivalent resolution at maximum scale.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the SphereVision Immersive 5mm, and how does it affect display quality?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 5.0mm, offering a fine balance between resolution and viewing distance. This ensures crisp, clear visuals suited for immersive dome environments, delivering vibrant imagery without visible pixelation from typical viewing ranges.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED sphere display?</h3><p>Installation involves custom structural support tailored to the dome's diameter, which ranges from 5m to over 30m. Our expert team collaborates with architects and engineers to ensure safe, precise assembly optimized for your space.</p><h3>Can the SphereVision Immersive 5mm be integrated with spatial audio systems?</h3><p>Yes, it is fully compatible with spatial audio technology, enabling a multi-sensory immersive experience by synchronizing high-fidelity sound with the 360-degree visuals within the dome.</p><h3>How does the SphereVision Immersive 5mm compare with traditional projection domes?</h3><p>Unlike traditional projection domes dependent on projectors, SphereVision delivers direct LED illumination, providing higher brightness (800 nits), superior contrast, and richer colors with consistent image quality even in ambient light.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"bl-sph500\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/bl-sph500\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"styleshe