\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T6ed,<h1>SphereVision Immersive 5mm</h1><p>Brightluxx offers SphereVision Immersive 5mm LED displays in Dubai for stunning visual impact. Call for a quote in UAE today!</p><p><strong>Walk inside the display. Dome-scale immersion.</strong></p><p>Large-format LED sphere/dome for immersive walk-in experiences. Scales from 5m to 30m+ diameter for planetariums, theme parks, and immersive art installations. Interior projection with 16K equivalent resolution at maximum scale.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the SphereVision Immersive 5mm, and how does it affect display quality?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 5.0mm, offering a fine balance between resolution and viewing distance. This ensures crisp, clear visuals suited for immersive dome environments, delivering vibrant imagery without visible pixelation from typical viewing ranges.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED sphere display?</h3><p>Installation involves custom structural support tailored to the dome's diameter, which ranges from 5m to over 30m. Our expert team collaborates with architects and engineers to ensure safe, precise assembly optimized for your space.</p><h3>Can the SphereVision Immersive 5mm be integrated with spatial audio systems?</h3><p>Yes, it is fully compatible with spatial audio technology, enabling a multi-sensory immersive experience by synchronizing high-fidelity sound with the 360-degree visuals within the dome.</p><h3>How does the SphereVision Immersive 5mm compare with traditional projection domes?</h3><p>Unlike traditional projection domes dependent on projectors, SphereVision delivers direct LED illumination, providing higher brightness (800 nits), superior contrast, and richer colors with consistent image quality even in ambient light.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"SphereVision Immersive 5mm LED Display - Brightluxx Dubai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Brightluxx offers SphereVision Immersive 5mm LED displays in Dubai for stunning visual impact. Call for a quote in UAE today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sph500\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"p